    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d152">

                <pb facs="0321" n="225" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg225"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking, China</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-10-01"><hi rendition="#italic">October 1,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Street mob yesterday attacked foreigners en route railway to city, including
                    Bishop Cranston’s family. No one seriously hurt. The Government promises
                    adequate measures to prevent recurrence.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Conger.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
